      "name": "Combustible",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The first time each round that a pickled punk takes fire damage, its fumes combust, dealing 5 Fire Damage damage to all other creatures within the area of its Suffocating Fumes aura.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Suffocating Fumes",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "inhaled",
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>5 feet. A creature that enters or begins its turn within the aura must attempt a DC 14 Fortitude Saving Throw save, or DC 17 Fortitude Saving Throw if the pickled punk is attached to the creature.</p>\n<p>On a failed save, the creature is Sickened 1, and on a critical failure, it's also Enfeebled 1 for 1 minute.</p>",
